WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.925
What breaks in production,
and what guards against it?

2
00:00:02.925 --> 00:00:06.342
Read security advisories
with Reader alone and you

3
00:00:06.342 --> 00:00:09.600
see the advisory but not
its summary or resources.

4
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:14.425
Read from the wrong cloud and you get nothing,
and the gate passes on an empty list.

5
00:00:14.425 --> 00:00:18.513
Count an event per subscription
and one outage becomes five tasks.

6
00:00:18.513 --> 00:00:22.950
Read a retirement as an advisory
and the deadline passes unnoticed.

7
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:28.038
Mistake a kit rule for Microsoft's and you
argue about a date Microsoft never set.

8
00:00:28.038 --> 00:00:32.075
Apply the policy unreviewed and
resources appear everywhere.

9
00:00:32.075 --> 00:00:37.150
And per Learn, remediation may
overwrite hand edits to the alert rules.
